<description>&lt;p&gt;Nicolás Maduro and his wife have pleaded not guilty to U.S. conspiracy to torture charges in New York, while the United States has lifted sanctions on Jorge Rodríguez, head of Venezuela's National Assembly. The U.S. Space Force has deployed electromagnetic and electronic warfare systems against Venezuela, mirroring actions taken in Iran. A ReliefWeb update notes that purchasing power remains limited despite gradual macroeconomic and earthquake recovery. Two battle-related deaths were recorded in 2007, according to UCDP. In Chile, a Venezuelan gang member was sentenced to 20 years for kidnapping and killing a dissident.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFBOWEtSaTdPcDBycHFleVItZWtRTXBWSWs3bFVqZjZTZENLZFVTV0pSendaMlYzX2tGdzEtXzhvMDVTZHFUQmZZdGMxekRXdjZtcVhaVDJMeHEtZW95cFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxOQVZ3VzZsQTJMSnlVV1QwemJZSjRBY0JrWTdBbGg4VmhMbG8tZzRDOHhRU01NOWJCV25Iem05S1BqanZjbDdray1rNUFYOTBKZS0xT2R5UTVUeHE3N0FvVmppUU5Dem5SUXZQb3hYYXhNekdPRjVMVEdEMFpMUGk1MjZJZGZtNlUwSzgtN25FM0ZtRG9NVzJUWGtWU0djQTBiYkY1Q20xSzA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxQVXFnM3A0T3lJeVdPVnZrVlZHT3l6dlBUbjZkZGdmYTd4NTFkZEE1TkpOVkNxaXpoZVBiQUNSNWhrRGl4cXZxS2VWeHN5aVVfbEpSR2doM0xwR1JiZHA5VjdkLVhrVHhBMTlNQmQ1ZGNOSGd1bDhFOEFFQlpveFRpcG43MUZ1OEwwWGxqeXFrLUNwakUxOTU5R19rZEFTQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVkFVX3lxTFBzalRjQi02MVhNMGRLVDJoZXZoTFk1blgtdE1UY0NnRWtkWl9mTjNQNUhxWnRNa253akxmWjVmTndiN2JWRzAyQmxMeGRRM0xMM1dyMmVR?oc=5&quot;&gt;朝日新聞&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;h